\section{Objectives}

The major objectives of the project are:

\begin{enumerate}[label=\arabic*.]

\item To collect a large dataset of YouTube comments containing English and Hinglish expressions.

\item To understand the characteristics of user-generated social media comments.

\item To perform data cleaning and preprocessing on raw comments.

\item To remove irrelevant textual noise while preserving useful linguistic information.

\item To normalize the comments for further NLP processing.

\item To tokenize comments into meaningful textual units.

\item To apply appropriate stop-word and text-processing techniques.

\item To extract useful features from the processed comments.

\item To analyse the sentiment and emotional characteristics of comments.

