\section{Tokenization}

Tokenization refers to the segmentation of phrases or statements into different and smaller units known as tokens. \cite{jurafsky,bird}

For example:

\begin{quote}
``This movie bahut achha hai''
\end{quote}

may be represented as:

\begin{quote}
[This, movie, bahut, achha, hai]
\end{quote}

Tokenization enables subsequent operations such as word frequency analysis, stop-word processing and feature extraction. \cite{jurafsky,bird}

