\section{Emotion Analysis}

It should be noted that sentiment analysis and emotion analysis are different approaches. \cite{liu}

In sentiment analysis, the focus is on the polarity of the emotions (positive, negative and so on), while emotion analysis aims to identify the emotions in detail. \cite{pang,liu}

The types of emotions may include:

\begin{itemize}
\item Happiness
\item Sadness
\item Anger
\item Surprise
\item Fear
\item Humour
\item Appreciation
\item Neutral
\end{itemize}

For YouTube comments, emotion analysis can provide a more detailed understanding of audience reactions than simple sentiment polarity. \cite{liu,mohammad}

